        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>Derived from spectra technology, this high-tech spear can release a gout of plasma to reach any foe.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Fulminating Pike</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> to <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're trained with this weapon; <strong>Cost</strong> 10 battery charges</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Your plasma spike briefly lengthens, expands, and pulses, gaining the arc trait and increasing its reach to 15 feet for the duration of this effect. Strike for each action spent to use this ability, but each Strike must have a different target.</p>"
